# Ollama model for Miku's local brain.
# Base: Qwen2.5 3B Instruct. Benchmarked against 7B and qwen3:4b on this hardware:
# 3B matched 7B's tool-call accuracy (4/4) at ~3x the speed; qwen3:4b's thinking
# mode was far too slow and over-triggered tools. Swap FROM to qwen2.5:7b for more
# quality at the cost of latency.
#
# num_ctx is raised from Ollama's default 2048: the MCP tool schemas (web search,
# etc.) plus Miku's persona overflow it, which silently truncates the tools and
# makes the model hallucinate instead of calling them.
#
# Build / rebuild:
#   ollama create qwen2.5-miku -f Modelfile.miku
FROM qwen2.5:3b

PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
PARAMETER temperature 0.8
